        "enum": [
          "Open",
          "Closed",
          "Released",
          "Superseded"
        ],
        "description": "The Topic lifecycle. `Open` accrues messages; the closer moves an idle topic to\n`Closed` then `Released` (handed to the assistant). A high-similarity hit on a\nrecently-released topic may reopen it (back to `Open`) rather than start a new one.\n`Superseded` is terminal: the janitor split/merged the topic away — its stream is archived\nand its doc removed, so the status is only ever seen replaying the archived stream."
      },
